	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have fully committed to the artificer’s path, and your versatility is virtually without peer. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Constitution, Charisma, or Intelligence score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Engineering skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Engineering increases to a d12. You also gain an Engineering skill specialty. It does not count against your skill specialties known.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with sewing kits, smith’s tools or a type of artisan’s tools of your choice.</p></li><li><p>Choose a rare magic item. You add it to your schematic book for free.</p></li><li><p>You gain the second option for @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.pckq0dgz9f1i3ic8]{Advanced Tactical Chemistry}.</p></li></ul><p>Once you have selected this feat, you can no longer gain levels in classes other than artificer.</p>",
